### name: stmt.slice.smaller.mariadb
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"ITEMS":{"kind":"relation","from":"items","fields":{"ID":{"kind":"column","column":"id","type":"NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
ITEMS .> SORT_BY(_["id"]) .> TAKE(2) .> DROP(1)
--- expect
SELECT * FROM `items` ORDER BY `id` ASC LIMIT 1 OFFSET 1
===

